# Bioplues / ProofShield — .env.example

## Application
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=4000
API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000

## Security (Secrets must not be real)
JWT_SECRET=change_me_in_production_min_32_chars
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=change_me_in_production_min_32_chars
BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12

## CORS/WebSocket
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
WS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

## Database (if enabled)
DATABASE_URL=file:./data.db

## Rate Limiting
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=100

## Notes
- Optional: DB not required for frontend demo
- Change secrets in any deployed environment
- Do not commit .env
